{
    "title": "Merge Gardens",
    "description": "Discover the mysterious world of Myrtlegrove Estate, solve captivating puzzles, and combine unique objects to unveil secrets from the past.\r\n\r\nWhen Daisy inherits her missing uncle's old estate, her mission is to restore the mansion and its garden to sell it. However, she soon finds herself immersed in a world of mystery and intrigue. Fix up the old garden, meet exciting characters, and progress through a captivating story that spans generations. Merge, match, and solve puzzles to uncover the estate's hidden secrets.\r\n\r\nRESTORE AND DISCOVER\r\n- Begin your restoration journey at the mansion\u2019s gates.\r\n- Clear Evergrowth to reveal secrets in new areas.\r\n- Collect rare creatures to inhabit your garden.\r\n\r\nMERGE\r\n- Combine three of a kind to create superior items.\r\n- Discover hundreds of unique items and creatures.\r\n- Complete quests beyond the mansion\u2019s garden.\r\n\r\nSOLVE PUZZLES\r\n- Test your skills with hundreds of Match-3 puzzle levels.\r\n- Pop and blast 3D blocks for irresistible combos.\r\n- Earn rewards for your garden at each level.\r\n\r\nMyrtlegrove Estate's garden is full of human-shaped topiary statues and peculiar plants with sprawling roots. What has Daisy truly inherited? Renovate the estate and uncover the strange circumstances that led to her family's fractured past.\r\n\r\nFind your Green Thumbs and dive into the mystery. Immerse yourself in a relaxing game that combines merge and match mechanics. Download now and join Daisy in her adventure.\r\n\r\nFor comments, ideas, or suggestions, please contact us at mergegardens@futureplaygames.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover the mysterious world of Myrtlegrove Estate, solve captivating puzzles, and combine unique objects to unveil secrets from the past.<br><br>When Daisy inherits her missing uncle&#39;s old estate, her mission is to restore the mansion and its garden to sell it. However, she soon finds herself immersed in a world of mystery and intrigue. Fix up the old garden, meet exciting characters, and progress through a captivating story that spans generations. Merge, match, and solve puzzles to uncover the estate&#39;s hidden secrets.<br><br>RESTORE AND DISCOVER<br>- Begin your restoration journey at the mansion\u2019s gates.<br>- Clear Evergrowth to reveal secrets in new areas.<br>- Collect rare creatures to inhabit your garden.<br><br>MERGE<br>- Combine three of a kind to create superior items.<br>- Discover hundreds of unique items and creatures.<br>- Complete quests beyond the mansion\u2019s garden.<br><br>SOLVE PUZZLES<br>- Test your skills with hundreds of Match-3 puzzle levels.<br>- Pop and blast 3D blocks for irresistible combos.<br>- Earn rewards for your garden at each level.<br><br>Myrtlegrove Estate&#39;s garden is full of human-shaped topiary statues and peculiar plants with sprawling roots. What has Daisy truly inherited? Renovate the estate and uncover the strange circumstances that led to her family&#39;s fractured past.<br><br>Find your Green Thumbs and dive into the mystery. Immerse yourself in a relaxing game that combines merge and match mechanics. Download now and join Daisy in her adventure.<br><br>For comments, ideas, or suggestions, please contact us at mergegardens@futureplaygames.com",
